packages/game/types/rapier for NodeNext consumers.

---

The Gaussian splat kit (packages/world/src/kits/splat.js) was written for Mirage. Its techniques (a counting sort on
view depth with buckets spread by a depth histogram, skipping still cameras and splats behind the eye; culling tiny
and off-screen splats before the 2D covariance's eigen decomposition; anti-alias opacity compensation; the SOG
texture layout it reads; effect hooks on centre, rotation / scale and colour) were learnt from the PlayCanvas engine,
https://github.com/playcanvas/engine, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2011-2026 PlayCanvas Ltd. No PlayCanvas code is
included.
